---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Dental Implants & Cosmetic Dentistry in India | CareBridge Health"
  description="High-quality dental implants, crowns and smile makeovers in India with CareBridge Health. International patient coordination, expert dentists and transparent pricing."
>
  <main class="container mx-auto px-5 py-12 max-w-4xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 text-slate-900">
      Dental Implants & Cosmetic Dentistry in India
    </h1>

    <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-10">
      CareBridge Health connects international patients with experienced
      dental specialists in India for implants, crowns, root canal
      treatments and smile design procedures – at a fraction of Western
      prices.
    </p>

    <!-- Treatments -->
    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Treatments We Coordinate</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>Single and multiple dental implants</li>
        <li>Full mouth rehabilitation and All-on-4 / All-on-6 concepts</li>
        <li>Root canal treatments and crowns</li>
        <li>Veneers, laminates and smile makeover</li>
        <li>Teeth whitening and cosmetic corrections</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Why India / Why CareBridge -->
    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Why Choose India for Dental Care?</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>International quality materials and implant systems.</li>
        <li>Experienced prosthodontists and implantologists.</li>
        <li>Massive cost savings compared to US / UK / EU / Gulf.</li>
        <li>English-speaking teams familiar with overseas patients.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">How CareBridge Helps You</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li>Collecting your dental X-rays / OPG and case history.</li>
        <li>Getting a treatment plan and cost estimate from partner clinics.</li>
        <li>Arranging video consults with the dentist before you travel.</li>
        <li>Coordinating appointments so you finish maximum work in limited days.</li>
        <li>Helping with stay, local transport and post-treatment follow-up.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- Process -->
    <section class="mb-10 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Typical Treatment Timeline</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal list-inside text-slate-600 space-y-2">
        <li><strong>Pre-travel planning:</strong> You share scans / X-rays and expectations.</li>
        <li><strong>Doctor review:</strong> Dentist suggests options (implants vs bridges, etc.).</li>
        <li><strong>Costing:</strong> We send a clear estimate with number of visits needed.</li>
        <li><strong>In-clinic work:</strong> Procedures are completed as per the plan.</li>
        <li><strong>Follow-up:</strong> Online reviews and guidance once you are back home.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class="mb-12 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Dental Travel FAQ</h2>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          How many days do I need to stay for dental implants?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          For conventional implants you typically need two visits: first for
          implant placement, second (after 3–6 months) for crowns. In some
          selected cases, immediate loading or same-trip options may be
          possible – the dentist will confirm after reviewing your case.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Are the materials the same as in Western countries?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Partner clinics use globally recognised implant brands, cements and
          ceramics. If you prefer a specific system, let us know so we can
          match you with the right centre.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-slate-900">
          Can you plan treatment for limited vacation days?
        </h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">
          Yes. Once we know your dates, doctors try to cluster procedures and
          lab work to minimise extra trips while keeping safety first.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="mb-8">
      <div class="rounded-2xl bg-blue-50 px-6 py-6 md:px-8 md:py-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2">
          Need a quote for dental implants or smile makeover?
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 mb-4">
          Share your X-ray / OPG and current photos over WhatsApp. We’ll get a
          detailed plan and estimated cost from our partner dentists in India.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://wa.me/919080553616"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:bg-blue-700"
        >
          Chat with CareBridge on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
